Package: myanalysis
Title: Synthetic Reporting Fixture for the Rounding Skill Benchmark
Version: 0.1.0
Description: A deliberately seeded R package used as the frozen benchmark
    target for the `rounding` skill. It contains known-compliant and
    known-noncompliant rounding sites with a documented answer key.
    It is not a real analysis package and must not be used for reporting.
